<title>NETHERLANDS: WELNA 1996 NET PROFIT UP 23.5 PERCENT.</title>
<headline>WELNA 1996 NET PROFIT UP 23.5 PERCENT.</headline>
<dateline>OLDENZAAL, Netherlands 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     4.55 vs   3.68</p>
<p>    Net profit			     4.6  vs   3.7</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.50 vs   1.35</p>
<p>    Turnover			     107.6  vs  84.8</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     9.3  vs   4.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Plastics maker and trader Welna NV said earlier in</p>
<p>March it expected the 1996 net profit to show a rise of about 20</p>
<p>percent.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
